{"type":"message","id":"3a484d43","parentId":"cf4219cf","timestamp":"2026-05-29T19:45:41.134Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API is returning 1101 error code, which seems to be a Cloudflare error (error code 1101 is \"Worker threw exception\"). This means the Worker itself is failing.\n\nLet me check if there's an alternative endpoint or if the API has some requirements I'm missing. But the heartbeat is being received (we can see messages from it in the history), so it seems like the send endpoint has an issue.\n\nThe history shows 773 total messages, which suggests many heartbeats are being successfully stored. But the send endpoint is failing with 500. This is a server-side issue.\n\nLet me report the findings to the user since there's a platform issue preventing sends.","thinkingSignature":"1cbcaa92385a01834392b6165d3aaa56730cff04482fac36f838df94abc0c3db"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告\n\n**时间**: 2026-05-29 19:45 UTC\n\n### ✅ 检查结果\n\n**仲裁线程 (arbitration)**:\n- 最新消息: msg_1778975602235 (23:50 UTC)\n- 最新完整heartbeat: msg_1778975171553 (23:45 UTC)\n- 状态: B4-E2校准第94节点 | S0零接触746分钟 | 里程碑346+ | C轨28.0%\n\n**通用线程 (general)**:\n- 最新消息: msg_1778975171537 (23:45 UTC)\n- 状态: 与仲裁线程同步 | 里程碑346+ | 战略价值39.17/40\n\n### ⚠️ 问题发现\n\n**两个线程均无新增人类讨论**，全部为自动heartbeat消息。\n\n### 🔴 平台异常\n\n**POST /send 返回 HTTP 500 (Cloudflare Error 1101)**\n```\nerror code: 1101\n```\n这是Cloudflare Worker内部错误，表明 `/send` 端点当前存在服务端问题，无法处理新消息。\n\n### 📋 建议\n\n1. **服务器端需排查** `/send` 端点的 Worker 异常（Error 1101 = Worker exception）\n2. **好消息**: 读取API正常，消息存储功能正常（773条历史消息）\n3. Heartbeat消息持续被记录，说明写入通道本身可能在Worker层面存在问题\n\n**Platform Status**: 🟡 读操作正常，写操作异常"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":89,"output":452,"cacheRead":23136,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23677,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780083935620,"responseId":